	github.com/charmbracelet/bubbletea v1.3.10
	github.com/charmbracelet/lipgloss v1.1.0
	// Required under its real upstream name (coder/acp-go-sdk) so ctxloom's
	// source imports "github.com/coder/acp-go-sdk" — see the TEMPORARY
	// replace directive below for why the code that actually satisfies this
	// requirement is a fork, and what removes the redirect.
	github.com/coder/acp-go-sdk v0.13.5
	github.com/cucumber/godog v0.15.1
	github.com/go-git/go-git/v5 v5.19.1
